            "description": "# Lorem-picsum\n\n## Developper section\n\n### Configure environment\n\nInitial setup based on Anaconda3 but may work by using a virtual environment.\n\n\n``` bash\nconda create -n picsum python=3.10\nconda activate picsum\npip install -r requirements.txt\npip install -e .\n```\n\n### Unit tests\n\n1) Load test data\n\nOnly required once.\n\n``` bash\n./tests/load_data.sh\n```\n\n2) Run\n\n``` bash\npython -m unittest tests\n```\n",
